  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">ENSMI 2008-2009</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Maternal Health Survey 2008 - ENSMI</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xf6;d till genomf&#xf6;randet av den nationella enk&#xe4;ten om m&#xf6;dra- och barnh&#xe4;lsa i Guatemala 2008-09. Genomf&#xf6;rande parten &#xe4;r Universidad del Valle med tekniskt st&#xf6;d fr&#xe5;n Centres for Disease Control and Prevention (CDC Atlanta). Sidas st&#xf6;d g&#xe5;r fr&#xe4;mst till att slutf&#xf6;ra f&#xe4;ltarbetet och publicera de tv&#xe5; rapporterna om kvinnor respektive m&#xe4;n.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to the National Survey on Mother and Infant Health in Guatemala &quot;Encuesta Nacional de Salud Materno Infantil 2008&quot; - ENSMI 2008/09. The executing agency is Universidad del Valle with technical support from Centres for Disease Control and Prevention (CDC Atlanta). Sida support is directed to carry out and finalize field work and publish the reports on women and men.</narrative>
  </description>
